    "description": "The Security Camera is a free mod for Minecraft Pocket Edition that adds three new technological elements to the game - cameras. It will allow you to configure the system to monitor your site in mcpe and manage it from a safe distance.\r\nIt's a perfect surveillance system to use if you want to go out to hunt or do some mining but want to be kept updated on what's going on back at your house. For example, see if any zombies are trying to break in to your house or if a gang of creepers are hiding at your house waiting for you to come home.\r\n\r\nThese cameras are the perfect tool for keeping track of your territories and other players in the minecraft world. The mod is interesting in that while sitting at home you can watch what is happening 1000 blocks away from you, look at the world from the side.\r\nAll cameras that are added to minecraft pe are very simple in the crafting system:\r\nSecurity Camera (501) - 3 stones + 2 glass panes + 2 redstone dust + 2 iron ingots.\r\nSecurity Camera View (502) - 4 stones + 2 glass panes + 2 redstone dust + 1 iron ingot.\r\nCamera Remover (503) - 6 stones + 2 redstone dust + 1 iron ingot.\r\n\r\nYou can place the camera at any distance, provided that it is one Overworld / Nether world. By holding back the Security Camera View MCPE element, you will have access to two new GUI buttons: CV and X. These buttons are designed to control the camera, if you want to view the image from the camera and rotate it, press the CV button and rotate your finger as you want, and this will allow you to see from the same place where the security camera is located. Rotation in any direction is also possible! After crafting and placing the camera, you will need to give it a name so that you can later navigate which camera and where it is filming!\r\n\r\nNOTE: In our free application for minecraft pocket edition, you can also install other mods (for example Security Craft - which includes not only cameras, but also motion sensors, lasers to prevent penetration into your house and much more), skins with security and other themes, resource and texture packs for mcpe, 4k wallpapers for your smartphone with a Minecraft theme. Various backgrounds, improved versions of other mods and all this awaits you in our free mod for minecraft. Protect yourself and your friends with Security Camera for minecraft pe !! Good luck and fun tracking.\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: This application is not approved nor affiliated with Mojang AB, its name, commercial brand and other aspects of the application are registered brands and the property of their respective owners. This app adheres to the terms set out by Mojang. All items, names, places and other aspects of the game described within this application are trademarked and owned by their respective owners. We make no claim to and do not have any rights to any of the foregoing.",
